# Implementation plan — Spec 1.16.0

## Summary

Add a standalone **`payment/`** microservice (cloned from `email/` or `sms/`) that owns **system** billing: monthly company subscription invoices at **LKR 3,000**, starting from each company's **activation date** (`approved_at`). Super admins list **all companies' invoices** in the Payment admin UI, reachable from WebOnOne via platform-nav. Customer payments and payment gateways are **out of scope**.

See [01-overview.md](./01-overview.md), [02-payment-service-scaffold.md](./02-payment-service-scaffold.md), [03-system-billing-and-invoices.md](./03-system-billing-and-invoices.md), [04-super-admin-invoices-ui.md](./04-super-admin-invoices-ui.md), [05-platform-integration.md](./05-platform-integration.md).

| Project | Touch |
|---------|--------|
| `payment/` | New FE (admin) + BE + migrations; primary scope |
| `webonone-v2/` | Approve/reject → Payment upsert; env; Payment redirect |
| `packages/platform-nav/` | Super-admin Payment → Invoices |
| root `package.json` | `payment/` workspaces, `dev:payment`, `build:payment`, `migrate:payment` |

