## Phase 1 — Payment service scaffold

**Goal:** [02-payment-service-scaffold.md](./02-payment-service-scaffold.md) — standalone shell, auth, roles, root wiring.

**Exit criteria:** `dev:payment` login shell + `/health`; own DB `webonone_payment`.

| Task | Paths / detail |
|------|----------------|
| Clone service | Copy `sms/` or `email/` → `payment/`; ports 3017/4017; DB `webonone_payment` |
| Middleware | JWT auth, `X-Payment-Service-Key`, validateBody, requireRole |
| Base migrations | companies mirror, plans (+ seed LKR 3000), audit |
| Root wiring | workspaces; `dev:payment` on root `dev` |

**Verify:** `npm run type-check -w payment-root` · `npm run dev:payment`

---

## Phase 2 — System billing + invoices engine

**Goal:** [03-system-billing-and-invoices.md](./03-system-billing-and-invoices.md).

**Exit criteria:** Activation upsert → monthly invoices @ LKR 3000; idempotent; mark paid/void API.

| Task | Paths / detail |
|------|----------------|
| Domain migrations | subscriptions, invoices, lines; unique period key |
| Internal upsert | `/internal/companies/upsert` |
| Generator | `workers/invoiceGenerator.ts` + `/internal/invoices/generate` |
| Public API | invoices CRUD-ish (list/detail/status), dashboard |

**Verify:** `npm run migrate -w payment-root`; curl upsert + generate; list invoices.

